# /daily — show today's event log

## Usage
/daily

## What this does
Reads `Brain/log/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today's date) and displays the event log.

## Instructions
1. Determine today's date
2. Read `vault/Brain/log/<YYYY-MM-DD>.md`
3. Display the contents
4. If the file doesn't exist, report "No events logged today yet."
